  "display_title": "Interview with the Crazy Rich",
  "description": "Yang Seojun, director of Taeyang Solar, finds himself caught in a life-threatening storm during a vacation hike in Sweden. As he takes shelter, he meets a pretty writer named Ji Eun who offers him the last of her food as they await rescue. But when he's back home, he just can't forget her, so he concocts a company-funded writing contest to find her. It won't be easy... even his assistant has her reasons to prevent their reunion. Will Seojun find Ji Eun again, or will she be lost to him forever? \n\n(Source: Tapas)",
